✋ Gesture → Action List (Simple)
👍 Only Index finger up → Move mouse
👆 Index + Middle up → Left click
✌️ Index + Middle + Ring up → Right click
🖐️ All 5 fingers up → Scroll up
✊ All fingers down (fist) → Scroll down
👉 Index + Thumb up → Drag / hold click
🤏 Thumb only up → Release drag
☝️ Index finger raised (others folded) → Cursor slow mode
🖖 Index + Pinky up → Double click
🤘 Middle + Ring up only → Stop / pause control